5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To ensure our vision for the park is grounded in reality rather than mere aspiration, I shall examine the condition of works from the earlier programme and the upkeep ledger spend per hectare.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I believe we should be cautious about the actual execution of the work. I will look into the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help make the park amazing! I want to see how we'll actually take care of it later, so I'll check the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services and the upkeep ledger spend per hectare!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I believe we must identify who is actually responsible for the long-term maintenance. I will examine the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, as well as the volunteer groups working with the division.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To ensure the plan aligns with the actual behavior of the land and its users, I will examine the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we have a most comprehensive approach. By balancing the historical performance of our infrastructure with the current operational realities, we shall avoid the tragedy of a beautiful design that fails in practice.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It is better to identify potential bottlenecks in the construction and site management now than to deal with unexpected delays once the project has already begun.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,"That's so true, Misaki! I just want to make sure we don't pick something that's too hard to look after. It would be a shame if the park looked great at first but then got messy!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, that is a valid concern. However, the quality of maintenance depends entirely on the capacity of the people assigned to it. We must determine if the current staffing levels can actually sustain a new project.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, I agree that staffing is a key factor. However, we must also consider the physical constraints of the site. If the drainage or foot traffic patterns are ignored, even the best staff will struggle to maintain the park.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A most astute observation, Minako. It appears we are all attempting to peel back the layers of municipal optimism to find the actual bedrock of feasibility. I suspect the truth lies in the intersection of these data points.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I agree. The intersection of site constraints and contractor capacity will tell us if the proposed timelines are realistic or merely hopeful. I look forward to seeing if the data supports the plans.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm with you! I can't wait to see what we find. I just hope the numbers aren't too scary, because I really want this park to be a place where everyone can have fun for a long time!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Optimism is not a substitute for a sustainable plan, @Mio. I am interested in whether the city is relying on an overstretched workforce or unpaid volunteers to fill gaps in their operational capacity.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Regardless of the workforce, the land itself does not compromise. I believe that by understanding the physical stresses on the park, we can ensure the chosen plan is truly sustainable.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,It is heartening to see such a spirited commitment to rigor. I believe we have a balanced strategy; let us now proceed to the archives and see if the reality of the past informs the promises of the future.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let us see what the records reveal. I am ready to proceed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm ready too! Let's go find some answers! I'll do my best to help us pick the perfect plan for the city! See you all soon!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Let us move to the investigation phase. I hope the records provide a clear picture of the actual human resources available for this project. I am ready.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let us proceed with our investigations. I look forward to seeing how the physical data aligns with the proposed visions for the park. I am ready.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
